  "body": "Introducing for the first time, an exceptional brand-new penthouse at 18/423 Beach Road, Mairangi Bay - a rare opportunity to secure luxurious coastal living in one of the North Shore’s most coveted seaside positions.\r\n\r\nElevated above the shoreline with uninterrupted panoramic views across the Hauraki Gulf, this sophisticated residence captures everything that makes life by the beach so desirable. Light-filled, beautifully appointed and designed for effortless entertaining, this is a home where the view is always part of the experience.\r\n\r\nAt the heart of the penthouse, an expansive north-facing living and dining area opens seamlessly to a generous entertainer’s deck. Whether hosting friends, enjoying a quiet morning coffee or simply watching the ever-changing colours of the sea, this exceptional outdoor space provides the perfect setting for relaxed coastal living.\r\n\r\nThe master suite is a private retreat, complete with ensuite, abundant storage and direct access to the deck. Two further bedrooms provide flexibility for family, guests or a home office, complemented by a generous main bathroom and separate laundry.\r\n\r\nEvery detail has been thoughtfully considered. Integrated storage provides practicality without compromising the clean, sophisticated aesthetic, while quality appliances - including a fridge/freezer - mean this home is ready to move into and enjoy from day one.\r\n\r\nOne of the East Coast Bays’ most treasured beaches is virtually on your doorstep, complete with its own Surf Lifesaving Club. Wander into the vibrant Mairangi Bay village for your morning coffee, meet friends for lunch, enjoy dinner at a favourite restaurant or browse the boutique retail offerings.\r\n\r\nThe supermarket, cafes, bars, tennis club and bowls club are all close by, creating the ultimate lock-up-and-leave lifestyle where the car can happily stay parked.\r\n\r\nBrand new, beachside and beautifully designed. This will be your daily reminder that you have arrived somewhere rather special.",
